{"tool_name":"roi-statistics","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This tool compute measures on the ROIs of the chosen sequence, updates the measures live when ROIs are changed and allows to copy/paste the measures to 3rd-party sheet edition softwares. Measures include geometric (bounding box) and intensity information.</p>\n\n<p>It can complement the default ICY built inROI table, where measurements such as volume meausirements, intensity measurements, ... are built in and can be exported as excel as well.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This tool compute measures on the ROIs of the chosen sequence, updates the measures live when ROIs are changed and allows to copy/paste the measures to 3rd-party sheet edition softwares. Measures include geometric (bounding box) and intensity information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It can complement the default ICY built inROI table, where measurements such as volume meausirements, intensity measurements, ... are built in and can be exported as excel as well.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-08-07T13:43:36+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:41+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505206033,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Dufour Alexandre"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":1,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"ff7211b9-a937-4c33-aac3-22aa10053480","url":"/user/1"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4074,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Feature_extraction","url":"/object-feature-extraction"},{"target_id":4007,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_S